white shirt is partially visible to the left, and another person in dark clothing is blurred in the distance. The market has a rustic, wooden structure with hanging items and a dimly lit atmosphere. The photograph has a shallow depth of field, focusing sharply on the woman while the background remains softly blurred. The overall style of the photograph is realistic and naturalistic, with a focus on the woman's poised and elegant stance amidst the bustling market setting."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 180, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [386.9935607910156, 369.097412109375], "pos": [114.75933074951172, 1394.6136474609375], "id": 119, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 32}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "slot_index": 0, "links": [177], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["auto", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 181, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [400, 340], "pos": [452.9061584472656, 1356.6656494140625], "id": 120, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 36}, {"outputs": [{"name": "*", "label": "输出", "type": "*"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["原始图"], "inputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "link": 147, "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "SetNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [210, 60], "pos": [-925.7432250976562, -132.46432495117188], "id": 69, "properties": {"previousName": "原始图", "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [179], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_